From: enij90 <226572015+enij90@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] feat(Hardware Support): accept the Lenovo TB321FU IMU bridge

The TB321FU's accelerometer and gyroscope sit behind the Qualcomm sensor
core, with no IIO device; tb321fu-imu-bridge reports them as the uinput
device "TB321FU IMU" (accel ABS_X/Y/Z, gyro ABS_RX/RY/RZ, imu_generic).
Virtual devices are skipped unless whitelisted, so add it.

--- a/src/input/manager.rs
+++ b/src/input/manager.rs
@@ -65,6 +65,9 @@
     "Sunshine gamepad (virtual) motion sensors",
     "Sunshine Nintendo (virtual) pad",
     "MSI WMI hotkeys",
+    // Lenovo TB321FU: accelerometer + gyroscope from the sensor core (SSC),
+    // reported through uinput by tb321fu-imu-bridge.
+    "TB321FU IMU",
 ];
 
 #[derive(Error, Debug)]
